  "broader": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/ed/321",
  "definition": "Maximum Sizes for School Buildings",
  "effectiveDate": "2025-03-14",
  "historyNote": "#8265, eff 1-22-05; ss by #10363, eff 6-15-13; ss by #13054, eff 6-12-20; ss by #14023, eff 7-12-24 (formerly Ed 321.06); ss by #14215, eff 3-14-25",
